2. nkilib, the NKI kernel library installed with the AWS Neuron SDK  (Apache License 2.0)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  patches/vllm-neuron/0002-*.patch adds vllm_neuron/model/mimo_v2/nki_moe_tkg/, a copy of the moe_tkg
  (MoE token generation) kernels of nkilib (nki 0.7.0, Neuron SDK 2.33.0) with an all-expert path and a
  fix of the PSUM bank offset of the FP8 row scales.

