6. Test media and evaluation data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  assets/audio/jfk.wav: excerpt of the 1961 inaugural address of John F. Kennedy (a work of the U.S.
      federal government, public domain), from the Hugging Face dataset Xenova/transformers.js-docs, resampled.
  All other files in assets/ are synthetic (rendered digits, shapes and tones).
  data/task_eval/gsm8k_test_200_seed0.jsonl: 200 questions of the GSM8K test split (MIT License,
      https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math), selected with random.Random(0).
  data/task_eval/mmlu_test_200_seed0.jsonl: 200 questions of the MMLU test split (MIT License,
      https://github.com/hendrycks/test), selected with random.Random(0).
